      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازنم الشَّجَرُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>The tress had a</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَمَة</span></b>  (K, TA)
[i. e. <i>an excrescence</i>] <i>resembling the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَمَة</span> <i>of the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاة</span> [app. here meaning <i>sheep</i> as well as <i>goat;</i>
though sheep are said in the S, and in one place
in the TA, to have no <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَمَة</span>]. (TA.)

